Package: patrone-browser-chooser
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, flatpak, gnome-software-plugin-flatpak
Recommends: patrone-software
Description: Asks which web browser to install, the first time one's needed
 PatroneOS comes with no web browser. The first time one's needed,
 from the taskbar's Web browser button or a link opened in any app,
 Patrone Browser Chooser asks which to install: Chromium, Firefox, Brave,
 Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, Vivaldi, Opera, LibreWolf, Zen Browser or
 GNOME Web. Patrone Software installs it from Flathub; it then becomes the
 default for web links and opens, with the link that was waiting.
